    "html": "<p>Electrons in an atom transition directly from energy level <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"n = 3\"></span> to <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"n = 1\"></span> by emitting a photon. The photons form an emission line in the visible region of the electromagnetic spectrum. </p>\n<p>What are possible energy values for energy levels <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"n = 1\"></span> and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"n = 3\\,?\"></span></p>\n\n<p> </p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>Possible energy value for energy level <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"n = 1\"></span></td>\n<td>Possible energy value for energy level <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"n = 3\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"A\">\n<td><strong>A.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"-10.48\"></span> eV</td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"-8.23\"></span> eV</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"B\">\n<td><strong>B.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"-10.48\"></span> eV</td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"-4.66\"></span> eV</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"C\">\n<td><strong>C.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"-9.01\"></span> eV</td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"-8.23\"></span> eV</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"D\">\n<td><strong>D.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"-9.01\"></span> eV</td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"-4.66\"></span> eV</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
